OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry day with lengthy sunny
OL,6,Fspells between patchy amounts of
OL,7,Fcloud. More in the way of cloud for
OL,8,FUpper Tayside but still remaining dry.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FDry with long clear periods
OL,11,Fthis evening for most places.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FPartly cloudy with a few
OL,14,Fshowers at first. Then drier and
OL,15,Fbrighter for a time, but turning
OL,16,Fcloudier with rain and strengthening
OL,17,Fwinds in the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
